Description: ncurses, its tools and the terminfo database
 Wide-character ncurses 6.0 libraries, terminal tools and terminal
 descriptions, including the panel, form and menu libraries.

Package: ncurses-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: ncurses (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ncurses development headers
 Public headers for the ncurses, panel, form and menu libraries.
 The library links are provided by the essential ncurses package.
